ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"selection\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">厳選10選！銀座・有楽町のおすすめ絶景温泉宿・名門旅館</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4 gap-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1選</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">ホテルザセレスティン銀座</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 5（141件）</span>\n      <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-red-50 text-red-700 font-bold text-xs rounded-full border border-red-200\">目安 ¥31,410〜</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-6 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-5/12\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/160990/160990.jpg\" alt=\"ホテルザセレスティン銀座\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-100 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-7/12 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">\n      <p class=\"font-bold text-amber-900 bg-amber-50/70 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-100/60\">💡 ～All for you～　やがて銀座のランドマークとなるような100年先まで愛されるホテル。</p>\n      <p><strong>【所在地・エリア】</strong> 📍 東京都中央区銀座8-4-22</p>\n      <p><strong>【交通アクセス】</strong> 🚃 ＪＲ山手線新橋駅銀座口　徒歩3分　地下鉄東京メトロ銀座線新橋駅5番出口徒歩3分　</p>\n      <p><strong>【ホテルザセレスティン銀座の活用術】</strong> 早期予約プランや「5と0のつく日」クーポンを組み合わせることで、上位客室や旬の味覚コースも手頃に予約しやすくなります。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-2 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F160990%2F160990.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"sponsored noopener noreferrer\"